1
00:00:00,707 --> 00:00:02,707
== sync, corrected by elderman ==
@elder_man

2
00:00:05,632 --> 00:00:07,632
(Sheldon:)Thank you for coming by,
gentlemen.

3
00:00:07,635 --> 00:00:09,335
(Howard:)No problem.
So what's up?

4
00:00:09,337 --> 00:00:12,807
(Sheldon:)Well, it was the two of you who
found Amy Farrah Fowler for me.

5
00:00:12,807 --> 00:00:14,777
(Sheldon:)Now that I'm looking
for my next girlfriend,

6
00:00:14,775 --> 00:00:18,345
(Sheldon:)it seemed only logical that I
employ your services once again.

7
00:00:18,346 --> 00:00:21,146
Y-You sure you're up for that?
She did hurt you.

8
00:00:21,148 --> 00:00:24,048
(Sheldon:)Oh, no, it's all right.
I think of my time with Amy

9
00:00:24,051 --> 00:00:27,691
as a stick of Fruit Stripe gum:
sweet and enjoyable at first,

10
00:00:27,688 --> 00:00:31,358
(Sheldon:)but ultimately
a flavorless lump of sadness.

11
00:00:32,359 --> 00:00:34,159
(Raj:)You're not wrong
about Fruit Stripe.

12
00:00:34,161 --> 00:00:37,531
I-I was always
a Hubba Bubba man. Mm.

13
00:00:37,531 --> 00:00:40,671
(Howard:)Hubba Bubba over Dubble Bubble?
You're crazy.

14
00:00:40,668 --> 00:00:43,768
(Raj:)Hey, the jaw wants
what it wants.

15
00:00:43,771 --> 00:00:45,471
Gentlemen!

16
00:00:45,473 --> 00:00:47,373
(Raj:)Oh, right, uh, girlfriend. Okay.

17
00:00:47,375 --> 00:00:48,975
(Howard:)But what are you
looking for?

18
00:00:48,976 --> 00:00:50,346
(Sheldon:)All I'm looking for

19
00:00:50,344 --> 00:00:52,944
(Sheldon:)is an educated, intelligent
woman who shares my interests

20
00:00:52,947 --> 00:00:54,947
(Sheldon:)while retaining
her own unique point of view.

21
00:00:54,949 --> 00:00:56,119
(Sheldon:)She should be kind,

22
00:00:56,117 --> 00:00:57,247
(Sheldon:)patient,

23
00:00:57,251 --> 00:00:58,621
(Sheldon:)and most important,

24
00:00:58,619 --> 00:01:02,759
(Sheldon:)unable to imagine life
without me by 10:00 tonight.

